[stderr] ## First-release scope and measurable success measures
[stderr] 
[stderr] Included scope: playable exploration; one town and one dungeon; narrative,
[stderr] dialogue, quests, progression and a short ending; onboarding/tutorial; at least
[stderr] one tutorialized turn-based battle; inventory and rewards; save/load, resume,
[stderr] checkpoints, data-loss recovery; settings and accessibility; audio/visual
[stderr] feedback; content/level delivery; and crash reporting with player-facing error
[stderr] recovery. The source also names account/identity, multiplayer/player safety,
[stderr] live-service operations, and purchase/entitlement handling, but their release
[stderr] status remains contingent on the explicit conflict decision below.
