[stderr]   ending; added regions or chapters are not needed for release completion.
[stderr] - Both targets meet their stated input role; the PWA is installable and each
[stderr]   target has a tested offline, save, update, and error-recovery path.
[stderr] - Dialogue, inventory, quest, and progression UI are readable with approved
[stderr]   accessibility settings, and captions/visual settings are available where the
[stderr]   corresponding feedback exists.
[stderr] - An interruption, recoverable error, or safe update offers a player-facing
